{"title":"Security Agencies Worldwide Found to Use Ad-Based Surveillance System","link":"https://citizenlab.ca/security-agencies-worldwide-found-to-use-ad-based-surveillance-system/","date":1794622541000,"content":"<a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50492950\">Comments</a><div class=\"hn-comments\"><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=qchris\">qchris</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50494113\">Nov 14, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">If you click through, you're more likely going to be interested in the two that this page links to. The Bloomberg report is more recent (last week) while Citizen Lab's own reporting on the topic is dated from April. You'll need to read either (both?) to get a full sense of what this particular linked piece is actually referencing.</div></div><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=blini-kot\">blini-kot</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50494538\">Nov 14, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">- I sure hope they wont be surveiling me today<p>%surveillance factory%</p></div></div><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=aquir\">aquir</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50494698\">Nov 14, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">Another reason to use adblockers! The internet is not just unbearable but also dangerous without it.</div><div class=\"hn-comment-children\"><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=BLKNSLVR\">BLKNSLVR</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50495026\">Nov 14, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">FBI agrees, from 2022: <a href=\"https://www.pcmag.com/news/fbi-recommends-installing-an-ad-blocker-to-dodge-scammers\">https://www.pcmag.com/news/fbi-recommends-installing-an-ad-b...</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=mso3i\">mso3i</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50494796\">Nov 14, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">Agentic browsing is going to shit on that system soon.</div><div class=\"hn-comment-children\"><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=rdn\">rdn</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50494834\">Nov 14, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">Your agent is spying on you</div><div class=\"hn-comment-children\"><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=mso3i\">mso3i</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50495082\">Nov 14, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">I done the basin and put im thro is paces, all on me Jack</div></div></div></div><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=ai_what\">ai_what</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50495147\">Nov 14, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">It's in games and applications too.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=RagnarD\">RagnarD</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50495083\">Nov 14, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">Miranda.</div></div></div>","author":"","comments":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50492950","siteTitle":"Hacker News","siteHash":"37bb545430005dba450c1e40307450d8e4e791b434e83f3d38915ebad510fd50","entryHash":"50727677ba71fd00c2fba4649505c48f4f926afb8318dbe07d182c9f9c3c033c","category":"Tech"}